{
  "movie_id": 201301501,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 1.0,
      "end_time": 2.7,
      "text": "Now, let us begin..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 3.0,
      "end_time": 5.0,
      "text": "the final battle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 13.5,
      "end_time": 15.0,
      "text": "GGRRRRRHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 15.3,
      "end_time": 17.3,
      "text": "The monsters suddenly went berserk!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 31.0,
      "end_time": 32.0,
      "text": "Makoto, look out!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 32.5,
      "end_time": 33.0,
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 36.5,
      "end_time": 38.5,
      "text": "Could you be more oblivious, girl?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 38.7,
      "end_time": 39.0,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 39.1,
      "end_time": 42.6,
      "text": "Who asked for your help?! We're mortal enemies!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 43.2,
      "end_time": 44.5,
      "text": "What would you say to a truce?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 45.0,
      "end_time": 48.0,
      "text": "I'll forgive your previous misconduct, so let us cooperate."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 48.7,
      "end_time": 51.4,
      "text": "If anyone needs forgiving, it's you, dammit!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 52.0,
      "end_time": 55.4,
      "text": "But... I guess beating up these monsters comes first."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 57.0,
      "end_time": 59.5,
      "text": "Hiiiyaaahhhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 66.0,
      "text": "How d'you like this?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 66.2,
      "end_time": 68.2,
      "text": "I can take you all at once!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 73.0,
      "end_time": 75.4,
      "text": "Yo, Rajraj, quit standing around and fight already!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 77.0,
      "end_time": 81.0,
      "text": "...Somehow, taking orders from you feels exceptionally unnatural."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 81.5,
      "end_time": 83.0,
      "text": "Nonetheless..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 84.0,
      "end_time": 88.0,
      "text": "Let me abandon any notion of retreat, and reroute all energy into offense!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 95.6,
      "end_time": 98.4,
      "text": "Why does this feel so very pleasant?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 99.0,
      "end_time": 100.4,
      "text": "Before I lost my memories,"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 100.5,
      "end_time": 104.8,
      "text": "was my personality callous with a taste for violence?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 105.0,
      "end_time": 106.0,
      "text": "Who cares?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 106.8,
      "end_time": 111.0,
      "text": "Memories? Personality? Screw that! You are who you are!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 111.1,
      "end_time": 113.6,
      "text": "And friends don't leave friends hanging!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 114.0,
      "end_time": 115.0,
      "text": "Hiyaahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 115.4,
      "end_time": 115.8,
      "text": "Ohhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 115.9,
      "end_time": 118.6,
      "text": "You've got a way with words, huh, big guy?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 118.8,
      "end_time": 120.6,
      "text": "You know, we might be pretty similar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 120.7,
      "end_time": 124.0,
      "text": "I fight to protect the things I care about too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 125.0,
      "end_time": 126.4,
      "text": "Hiyah-yah-yahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 126.8,
      "end_time": 129.0,
      "text": "Whoaaa! Don't charge in headfirst!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 129.2,
      "end_time": 131.2,
      "text": "They'll move in and surround you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 132.0,
      "end_time": 133.6,
      "text": "Tch, nothin' for it..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 133.8,
      "end_time": 135.0,
      "text": "I'll keep you safe myself!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 135.8,
      "end_time": 137.4,
      "text": "If we're fighting together, we're buds, right?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 138.0,
      "end_time": 138.8,
      "text": "Ahaha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 139.0,
      "end_time": 141.0,
      "text": "You wanna be friends with me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 141.1,
      "end_time": 144.0,
      "text": "Sounds good! Let's be great pals!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 144.4,
      "end_time": 147.6,
      "text": "But are you sure you don't want Mr. Knight to power you up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 148.0,
      "end_time": 150.8,
      "text": "Look, he's right there! I can ask him for you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 151.4,
      "end_time": 154.0,
      "text": "That's right! Don't be shy, Mr. Daikon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 155.0,
      "end_time": 156.6,
      "text": "My name ain't Daikon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 156.7,
      "end_time": 160.8,
      "text": "Do I look like some kinda radish to you or somethin'?!"
    }
  ],
